GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "DF5A38DAA362E419"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{D69F517BD460E13E}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2020-07-06"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Kunar, Afghanistan"\
     ""\
     "Two months ago, U.S. forces operating in eastern Afghanistan were attacked by a newly emerging insurgent faction using improvised FPV drones carrying explosive payloads. The attack resulted in multiple casualties and marked the first mass use of locally manufactured strike drones in the region."\
     ""\
     "Subsequent ISR flights and human intelligence have identified the likely source of these drones - a concealed manufacturing and assembly facility located on the outskirts of the village of Gulahy Shal."\
     ""\
     "Tonight, a platoon from the 75th Ranger Regiment will conduct a night air assault to neutralize the facility before additional drone attacks can be carried out against U.S. forces in the region."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{13B782EF7AEF7AB1}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "<b>Date:</b> 2020-07-06"\
     "<b>Location:</b> Kunar, Afghanistan"\
     ""\
     "Brothers, two months ago, by the will of Allah, we struck the American forces in this region using the drones built by our own hands. These attacks showed the enemy that even their strength and technology cannot protect them from those who are patient and determined."\
     ""\
     "Since that day, the Americans have been searching for us. Their aircraft watch from above, and their spies move among the villages. "\
     "We must assume they will come. "\
     ""\
     "But this place is important, brothers. It is here that we prepare the tools that allow us to strike the enemy again and again. The work being done here must continue."\
     ""\
     "Tonight, remain vigilant. Watch the sky and the surrounding hills. If the enemy comes, we will be ready, insha’Allah."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1B5DA8C16F736FA3}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "SITUATION"
     m_sContent "Two months after insurgents used locally built FPV drones to successfully attack U.S. forces, American intelligence identified a concealed drone manufacturing site near Gulahy Shal as the source. A platoon from the 75th Ranger Regiment is now preparing a night air assault to destroy the facility, gather intelligence, and prevent further attacks. Meanwhile, approximately 30 insurgents at the compound, aware they may be targeted, are prepared to defend the site."\
     ""\
     "<b>RATIO: 1:1.5</b>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F3EE61053B577EAF}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "At <b>0130</b> local, Ranger forces (029 030) will conduct an air assault raid on the objective compound (033 003) in order to:"\
     ""\
     "- <b>Destroy the insurgents' drone caches located inside the drone factory</b> "\
     ""\
     "- <b>ISR shows that insurgents' communications and planning center is located on the second floor of the drone factory. Recover any intelligence releted to the shipping routes of the drone parts from the location.</b>"\
     ""\
     "- <b>Locate and destroy an ammunition and weapons cache located somewhere inside the village of Gulahy Shal</b>"\
     ""\
     "Mission critical information: "\
     ""\
     "<i>- Air strikes and gun runs on drone factory are prohibited until intelligence has been recovered from the location.</i>"\
     ""\
     "<i>- ISR has spotted no enemy movement in the hills surrounding the objective area and any such threats will be dealt with. Approximate area with recorded enemy presence has been provided.</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A45B45695DE8E90C}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "MISSION"
     m_sContent "We must protect our drone factory and our weapons cache from the enemy. "
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EA82898D2195C2C9}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Primary assault force consists of one Ranger platoon with an attached demolitions element."\
     ""\
     "Friendly forces are blocking any enemy reinforcements west and north-east of the objective village."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0AF87563633995F2}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "FRIENDLY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Brothers, we are around thirty men gathered here to defend this place and the work being done for the cause of Allah."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{BFBCF4F8AA97F4D6}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Enemy strength at the objective is assessed to be at approximately 30 insurgent fighters."\
     ""\
     "The insurgents are armed primarily with Eastern Bloc small arms and are wearing a mix of civilian and military clothing."\
     ""\
     "The enemy has also demonstrated extensive ability to deploy <b>IED FPV drones</b>, which may be launched from within the village or nearby structures once the assault begins."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C6A26039094B0A31}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "ENEMY FORCES"
     m_sContent "Our lookouts have reported numerous helicopters taking off from Bagram Airfield and heading south-east. "\
     ""\
     "We believe the Great Satan and his demons are targeting us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{50E4C2A71CFB5EC2}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "AIR PACKAGE"
     m_sContent "Insertion and extraction will be conducted via aircraft from the 160th Special Operations Aviation Regiment."\
     ""\
     "<b>Air package includes:</b>"\
     ""\
     "- 2x AH-6M Little Birds armed with miniguns and dumbfire rockets."\
     "- 1x UH-60 Black Hawk armed with door-mounted miniguns."\
     "- 3x UH-60 Black Hawk transport helicopters."\
     ""\
     "<b>Suggested load plan:</b>"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ & Weapons Element -> Disco-1"\
     "Assault Element A -> Disco-2"\
     "Assault Element B -> Disco-3"\
     "Security Element -> Disco-4"\
     "Demolitions Team -> as per CO's intent."\
     ""\
     "<b>Suggested fold in:</b>"\
     ""\
     "After inserting the troops, it is suggested that pilots fold in to achieve the most with the assets at their disposal:"\
     ""\
     "Disco-2 -> Disco-1 (door gun operation and location based jamming)"\
     "Disco-3 -> Chaos-1 (camera pod operation and targeting)"\
     "Disco-4 -> Chaos-2 (camera pod operation and targeting)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{2BBC915BEDB9DB23}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & SUPPLY"
     m_sContent "Our soldiers are equipped with simple but effective weapons. We also have a number of sappers that are proficient in setting up IEDs."\
     ""\
     "Located inside our cache, we also have:"\
     ""\
     "- 1x PKM and ammo for it."\
     ""\
     "- 1x UK59 and ammo for it."\
     ""\
     "- 100x sandbags that can be used to secure our defenses."\
     ""\
     "- Various weapons and ammo we have managed to secure during our operations."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{EEE9889C8E841300}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "COMSIG"
     m_sContent "<b>Platoon net:</b> 48.0 MHz"\
     "<b>Air net:</b> 49.0 MHz"\
     ""\
     "<b>Callsigns:</b>"\
     ""\
     "Platoon HQ : Blazer White 1"\
     "Assault Element A : Blazer White 2"\
     "Assault Element B : Blazer White 3"\
     "Security Element : Blazer White 4"\
     "Weapons Element : Blazer White 5"\
     "Demolition Team : Blazer White 6"\
     ""\
     "<b>Aviation Callsigns:</b>"\
     ""\
     "JTAC: Music"\
     "Lead attack : Chaos-1"\
     "Secondary attack : Chaos-2"\
     "Lead armed transport : Disco-1"\
     "Transport : Disco-2"\
     "Transport : Disco-3"\
     "Transport : Disco-4"\
     ""\
     "<i>IR strobes are available for aerial identification.</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F5D978DD3F38BFBC}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "INFORMATION ON DRONES"
     m_sContent "<b>Drones are located in the drone factory building, inside the green boxes that are on the shelves.</b>"\
     ""\
     "We currently have:"\
     ""\
     "- 2x Recon FPV drones"\
     ""\
     "- 6x IED FPV drones"\
     ""\
     "Previous attempts to strike enemy <b>transport helicopters</b> have shown that they possess jamming capabilities. Their infantry on the ground is likely to be much more vulnerable."\
     ""\
     "<i>Press \"N\" while in drone view to activate night vision.</i>"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{DAD446BD11EA8359}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "ADMIN & SUPPLY"
     m_sContent "Soldiers are equipped with their standard combat load."\
     ""\
     "A variety of weapon attachments are located at the airfield and are free to be used, 3x tactical ladders have also been provided."\
     ""\
     "No resupply or repair is available for the helicopters at this time."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{0C500F504301D384}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "END CONDITIONS"
     m_sContent "- 85% Blufor killed"\
     "- 95% Opfor killed"\
     "- Completion of Blufor objectives"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{427727387B3A8F87}" {
     m_iOrder 15
     m_sTitle "EW CAPABILITIES"
     m_sContent "MH-60 Black Hawk transport helicopters have been furnished with non-removable drone jammers. "\
     ""\
     "You can expect the drone signal to start to degrade when they enter ~200m wide interference bubble centered around the helicopter. The drone becomes uncontrolable as it approaches the center of the interference area."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{187649D47EA630E0}" {
     m_iOrder 16
     m_sTitle "MM NOTES (PLEASE READ)"
     m_sContent "MM intent is for the insurgents to conduct defence of the village inside well protected buildings."\
     ""\
     "You have been given sandbags, but they <b>should not</b> be placed in a way that prevents Blufor entry to buildings (no door jamming etc.)"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_INSURGENT"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D0C75AE1434FD1C0}" {
     m_iOrder 17
     m_sTitle "END CONDITIONS"
     m_sContent "- 85% Blufor killed"\
     "- 95% Opfor killed"\
     "- Completion of Blufor objectives"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ACBE9516A92BD034}" {
     m_iOrder 18
     m_sTitle "MM NOTES (PLEASE READ)"
     m_sContent "MM intent is for Blufor to conduct a fast raid on to the objectives. Approximate AO where you can expect to meet resistance has been provided so there is no need to land far away."\
     ""\
     "<b>Due to an issue I was not able to solve, specialty roles equiped with secondary weapons must drop them on the ground for them to become accesible.</b>"\
     ""\
     "Sources of light such as: lampposts, lamps etc. are mostly destructable."\
     ""\
     "Caches in all locations look like stacks of green crates."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
